@startuml
title Code - shared (types)
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

package "shared" {
  class Todo <<type>> {
    +id : string
    +title : string
    +completed : boolean
  }
  class TodoList <<type>> {
    +Todo[]
  }
  class CreateTodoInput <<type>> {
    +title : string
  }
  class UpdateTodoInput <<type>> {
    +completed : boolean
  }
}

note bottom of Todo
  Compile-time only. Imported as type by client and server.
  Not a runtime container or component.
end note

@enduml
